[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17582.07, "timestamp": "04:53:02", "text": "出色地。是的，他们两人都会收到通知。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17586.07, "timestamp": "04:53:06", "text": "是的。你好。嗯，大概就是这样。我这就收拾。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17588.708, "timestamp": "04:53:08", "text": "把线拉上来。谢谢各位的光临"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17593.07, "timestamp": "04:53:13", "text": "现在，好好享受剩下的时光吧！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17595.83, "timestamp": "04:53:15", "text": "晚上。别忘了让自己闪闪发光。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17599.75, "timestamp": "04:53:19", "text": "笑脸，而且很可爱。并且要容光焕发。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17604.15, "timestamp": "04:53:24", "text": "你就像一颗明星。所以，祝你好运"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17614.59, "timestamp": "04:53:34", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17617.15, "timestamp": "04:53:37", "text": "你好，保重。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17620.34, "timestamp": "04:53:40", "text": "每个人。请大家保重。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17633.39, "timestamp": "04:53:53", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17634.44, "timestamp": "04:53:54", "text": "连。"}]